#' @param atrfloat Character or numeric vector. Create or modify floating point attributes. The input values may be specified as a single string in quotes or as a 1D filename or string, example '1 0.2 0 0 -0.2 1 0 0 0 0 1 0' or flipZ.1D or '1D:1,0.2,2@0,-0.2,1,2@0,2@0,1,0'
