#'
#' @param in_file Character; file path. A 3D+t AFNI brik dataset to be used for training. **Required.**
#' @param ttype Character. tname: classification or regression **Required.**
#' @param alphas Character; file path. output alphas file name
#' @param args Character. Additional parameters to the command
#' @param censor Character; file path. .1D censor file that allows the user to ignore certain samples in the training data.
#' @param kernel Character. string specifying type of kernel function:linear, polynomial, rbf, sigmoid
#' @param mask Character; file path. byte-format brik file used to mask voxels in the analysis
#' @param max_iterations Integer. Specify the maximum number of iterations for the optimization.
#' @param model Character; file path. basename for the brik containing the SVM model
#' @param nomodelmask Logical. Flag to enable the omission of a mask file
#' @param options Character. additional options for SVM-light
#' @param out_file Character; file path. output sum of weighted linear support vectors file name
#' @param trainlabels Character; file path. .1D labels corresponding to the stimulus paradigm for the training data.
#' @param w_out Logical. output sum of weighted linear support vectors
#' @param .cwd Working directory override.
#' @param .env Named character vector of environment variables.
#' @param .container Container configuration list.
#' @param dry_run Logical; preview command without executing.
#' @param echo Logical; echo stdout/stderr in real time.
