#' FREESURFER GTMPVC
#'
#' Perform Partial Volume Correction (PVC) to PET Data.
#'
#' @param in_file Character; file path. input volume - source data to pvc **Required.**
#' @param reg_file Character; file path. LTA registration file that maps PET to anatomical **Required.**
#' @param reg_identity Logical. assume that input is in anatomical space **Required.**
#' @param regheader Logical. assume input and seg share scanner space **Required.**
#' @param segmentation Character; file path. segfile : anatomical segmentation to define regions for GTM **Required.**
#' @param X Logical. save X matrix in matlab4 format as X.mat (it will be big)
#' @param X0 Logical. save X0 matrix in matlab4 format as X0.mat (it will be big)
#' @param args Character. Additional parameters to the command
#' @param auto_mask Character or numeric vector. FWHM thresh : automatically compute mask
#' @param beta Logical. save beta matrix in matlab4 format as beta.mat
#' @param color_table_file Character; file path. color table file with seg id names
#' @param contrast Character or numeric vector. contrast file
#' @param default_color_table Logical. use $FREESURFER_HOME/FreeSurferColorLUT.txt
#' @param default_seg_merge Logical. default schema for merging ROIs
#' @param frame Integer. only process 0-based frame F from inputvol
#' @param km_hb Character or numeric vector. RefId1 RefId2 ... : compute HiBinding TAC for KM as mean of given RefIds
#' @param km_ref Character or numeric vector. RefId1 RefId2 ... : compute reference TAC for KM as mean of given RefIds
#' @param lat Logical. lateralize tissue types
#' @param mask_file Character; file path. ignore areas outside of the mask (in input vol space)
#' @param merge_cblum_wm_gyri Logical. cerebellum WM gyri back into cerebellum WM
#' @param merge_hypos Logical. merge left and right hypointensites into to ROI
#' @param mg Character or numeric vector. gmthresh RefId1 RefId2 ...: perform Mueller-Gaertner PVC, gmthresh is min gm pvf bet 0 and 1
#' @param mg_ref_cerebral_wm Logical. set MG RefIds to 2 and 41
#' @param mg_ref_lobes_wm Logical. set MG RefIds to those for lobes when using wm subseg
#' @param mgx Numeric. gmxthresh : GLM-based Mueller-Gaertner PVC, gmxthresh is min gm pvf bet 0 and 1
#' @param no_pvc Logical. turns off PVC entirely (both PSF and TFE)
#' @param no_reduce_fov Logical. do not reduce FoV to encompass mask
#' @param no_rescale Logical. do not global rescale such that mean of reference region is scaleref
#' @param no_tfe Logical. do not correct for tissue fraction effect (with --psf 0 turns off PVC entirely)
#' @param num_threads Integer. threads : number of threads to use
#' @param opt_brain Logical. apply adaptive GTM
#' @param opt_seg_merge Logical. optimal schema for merging ROIs when applying adaptive GTM
