#' @param source_file Character; file path. volume to be registered **Required.**
#' @param target_file Character; file path. target volume for the registration **Required.**
#' @param args Character. Additional parameters to the command
#' @param est_int_scale Logical. estimate intensity scale (recommended for unnormalized images)
#' @param force_double Logical. use double-precision intensities
#' @param force_float Logical. use float intensities
#' @param half_source Character or numeric vector. write source volume mapped to halfway space
#' @param half_source_xfm Character or numeric vector. write transform from source to halfway space
#' @param half_targ Character or numeric vector. write target volume mapped to halfway space
#' @param half_targ_xfm Character or numeric vector. write transform from target to halfway space
#' @param half_weights Character or numeric vector. write weights volume mapped to halfway space
#' @param high_iterations Integer. max # of times on highest resolution
#' @param in_xfm_file Character; file path. use initial transform on source
#' @param init_orient Logical. use moments for initial orient (recommended for stripped brains)
#' @param iteration_thresh Numeric. stop iterations when below threshold
#' @param least_squares Logical. use least squares instead of robust estimator
#' @param mask_source Character; file path. image to mask source volume with
#' @param mask_target Character; file path. image to mask target volume with
#' @param max_iterations Integer. maximum # of times on each resolution
#' @param no_init Logical. skip transform init
#' @param no_multi Logical. work on highest resolution
#' @param out_reg_file Character or numeric vector. registration file; either True or filename
#' @param outlier_limit Numeric. set maximal outlier limit in satit
#' @param registered_file Character or numeric vector. registered image; either True or filename
#' @param subsample_thresh Integer. subsample if dimension is above threshold size
#' @param trans_only Logical. find 3 parameter translation only
#' @param weights_file Character or numeric vector. weights image to write; either True or filename
#' @param write_vo2vox Logical. output vox2vox matrix (default is RAS2RAS)
#' @param .cwd Working directory override.
#' @param .env Named character vector of environment variables.
#' @param .container Container configuration list.
