#' FSL FLIRT
#'
#' FSL FLIRT wrapper for coregistration
#'
#' @param in_file Character; file path. input file **Required.**
#' @param reference Character; file path. reference file **Required.**
#' @param angle_rep Character; one of: "quaternion", "euler". representation of rotation angles
#' @param apply_isoxfm Numeric. as applyxfm but forces isotropic resampling
