#' FSL FUGUE
#'
#' FSL FUGUE set of tools for EPI distortion correction
#'
#' @param args Character. Additional parameters to the command
#' @param asym_se_time Numeric. set the fieldmap asymmetric spin echo time (sec)
#' @param despike_2dfilter Logical. apply a 2D de-spiking filter
#' @param despike_threshold Numeric. specify the threshold for de-spiking (default=3.0)
#' @param dwell_time Numeric. set the EPI dwell time per phase-encode line - same as echo spacing - (sec)
#' @param dwell_to_asym_ratio Numeric. set the dwell to asym time ratio
#' @param fmap_in_file Character; file path. filename for loading fieldmap (rad/s)
#' @param fmap_out_file Character; file path. filename for saving fieldmap (rad/s)
#' @param fourier_order Integer. apply Fourier (sinusoidal) fitting of order N
#' @param icorr Logical. apply intensity correction to unwarping (pixel shift method only)
#' @param icorr_only Logical. apply intensity correction only
#' @param in_file Character; file path. filename of input volume
#' @param mask_file Character; file path. filename for loading valid mask
#' @param median_2dfilter Logical. apply 2D median filtering
#' @param no_extend Logical. do not apply rigid-body extrapolation to the fieldmap
#' @param no_gap_fill Logical. do not apply gap-filling measure to the fieldmap
#' @param nokspace Logical. do not use k-space forward warping
#' @param pava Logical. apply monotonic enforcement via PAVA
#' @param phase_conjugate Logical. apply phase conjugate method of unwarping
#' @param phasemap_in_file Character; file path. filename for input phase image
#' @param poly_order Integer. apply polynomial fitting of order N
#' @param save_unmasked_fmap Logical. saves the unmasked fieldmap when using --savefmap
#' @param save_unmasked_shift Logical. saves the unmasked shiftmap when using --saveshift
#' @param shift_in_file Character; file path. filename for reading pixel shift volume
#' @param shift_out_file Character; file path. filename for saving pixel shift volume
#' @param smooth2d Numeric. apply 2D Gaussian smoothing of sigma N (in mm)
#' @param smooth3d Numeric. apply 3D Gaussian smoothing of sigma N (in mm)
#' @param unwarp_direction Character; one of: "x", "y", "z", "x-", "y-", "z-". specifies direction of warping (default y)
#' @param unwarped_file Character; file path. apply unwarping and save as filename
#' @param warped_file Character; file path. apply forward warping and save as filename
#' @param .cwd Working directory override.
#' @param .env Named character vector of environment variables.
#' @param .container Container configuration list.
#' @param dry_run Logical; preview command without executing.
#' @param echo Logical; echo stdout/stderr in real time.
#' @return An `ni_result` object.
#' @export
ni_fsl_fugue <- function(args = NULL,
                     asym_se_time = NULL,
                     despike_2dfilter = NULL,
                     despike_threshold = NULL,
                     dwell_time = NULL,
                     dwell_to_asym_ratio = NULL,
