#' FSL MELODIC
#'
#' Multivariate Exploratory Linear Optimised Decomposition into Independent
#'
#' @param in_files Character or numeric vector. input file names (either single file name or a list) **Required.**
#' @param ICs Character; file path. filename of the IC components file for mixture modelling
#' @param approach Character. approach for decomposition, 2D: defl, symm (default), 3D: tica (default), concat
#' @param args Character. Additional parameters to the command
#' @param bg_image Character; file path. specify background image for report (default: mean image)
#' @param bg_threshold Numeric. brain/non-brain threshold used to mask non-brain voxels, as a percentage (only if --nobet selected)
#' @param cov_weight Numeric. voxel-wise weights for the covariance matrix (e.g. segmentation information)
#' @param dim Integer. dimensionality reduction into #num dimensions (default: automatic estimation)
#' @param dim_est Character. use specific dim. estimation technique: lap, bic, mdl, aic, mean (default: lap)
#' @param epsilon Numeric. minimum error change
#' @param epsilonS Numeric. minimum error change for rank-1 approximation in TICA
#' @param log_power Logical. calculate log of power for frequency spectrum
#' @param mask Character; file path. file name of mask for thresholding
#' @param max_restart Integer. maximum number of restarts
#' @param maxit Integer. maximum number of iterations before restart
#' @param migp Logical. switch on MIGP data reduction
#' @param migpN Integer. number of internal Eigenmaps
#' @param migp_factor Integer. Internal Factor of mem-threshold relative to number of Eigenmaps (default: 2)
#' @param migp_shuffle Logical. randomise MIGP file order (default: TRUE)
#' @param mix Character; file path. mixing matrix for mixture modelling / filtering
#' @param mm_thresh Numeric. threshold for Mixture Model based inference
#' @param no_bet Logical. switch off BET
#' @param no_mask Logical. switch off masking
#' @param no_mm Logical. switch off mixture modelling on IC maps
#' @param non_linearity Character. nonlinearity: gauss, tanh, pow3, pow4
#' @param num_ICs Integer. number of IC's to extract (for deflation approach)
#' @param out_all Logical. output everything
#' @param out_dir Character; directory path. output directory name
#' @param out_mean Logical. output mean volume
#' @param out_orig Logical. output the original ICs
#' @param out_pca Logical. output PCA results
#' @param out_stats Logical. output thresholded maps and probability maps
#' @param out_unmix Logical. output unmixing matrix
#' @param out_white Logical. output whitening/dewhitening matrices
#' @param pbsc Logical. switch off conversion to percent BOLD signal change
#' @param rem_cmp Character or numeric vector. component numbers to remove
#' @param remove_deriv Logical. removes every second entry in paradigm file (EV derivatives)
#' @param report Logical. generate Melodic web report
#' @param report_maps Character. control string for spatial map images (see slicer)
#' @param s_con Character; file path. t-contrast matrix across subject-domain
#' @param s_des Character; file path. design matrix across subject-domain
#' @param sep_vn Logical. switch off joined variance normalization
#' @param sep_whiten Logical. switch on separate whitening
#' @param smode Character; file path. matrix of session modes for report generation
#' @param t_con Character; file path. t-contrast matrix across time-domain
#' @param t_des Character; file path. design matrix across time-domain
#' @param tr_sec Numeric. TR in seconds
#' @param update_mask Logical. switch off mask updating
#' @param var_norm Logical. switch off variance normalization
#' @param .cwd Working directory override.
#' @param .env Named character vector of environment variables.
#' @param .container Container configuration list.
#' @param dry_run Logical; preview command without executing.
#' @param echo Logical; echo stdout/stderr in real time.
#' @return An `ni_result` object.
#' @export
ni_fsl_melodic <- function(in_files,
                     ICs = NULL,
