#' FSL ProbTrackX
#'
#' Use FSL  probtrackx for tractography on bedpostx results
#'
#' @param fsamples Character or numeric vector **Required.**
#' @param mask Character; file path. bet binary mask file in diffusion space **Required.**
#' @param phsamples Character or numeric vector **Required.**
