#' @param target_masks Character or numeric vector. list of target masks - required for seeds_to_targets classification
#' @param use_anisotropy Logical. use anisotropy to constrain tracking
#' @param verbose Character; one of: "0", "1", "2". Verbose level, \[0-2\]. Level 2 is required to output particle files.
#' @param waypoints Character; file path. waypoint mask or ascii list of waypoint masks - only keep paths going through ALL the masks
